","value":"Make graph impact answer directional invalidation and provenance questions without crossing unrelated branches."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Agents and schedulers can re-run only work that actually derives from a changed item."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"One spanning node can collapse a workspace into a false blast radius, wasting compute and poisoning context ranking."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Directed, explainable impact traversal is shared by SDK, CLI, and MCP with trustworthy direction and cost receipts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"GitHub #1039 proves all three direction values are byte-identical and over-report two unrelated nodes in a five-node graph."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-7ob5"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"pm graph impact on 2026.8.15"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Create two independent dependency branches joined by one transfer item, then run graph impact from the first root with incoming, outgoing, and both."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Incoming returns transitive dependents, outgoing returns transitive prerequisites, and both returns their explicit union without reversing edges mid-path."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"All directions return the same undirected connected component and identical inspected-edge counts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-9rgaal","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-16T05:11:38.234Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-efuo34","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-16T05:11:38.234Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-ju83","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-16T05:11:38.234Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-16T05:11:38.234Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate-check evidence 2026-08-16: searched all 2,501 items across every status for GH-1039,graph impact direction,undirected dependency traversal,inert --direction,blast radius,and reverse reachability. Existing pm-ju83 and pm-7ob5 define the canonical graph-query and analytics contracts; open pm-mfy1ux concerns row bounds,not direction semantics. No item owns this exact directional-correctness regression."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"94f6df69b77515bec7e65cfd617951fccd6b5a00bbc360722ffdf81fe31e277a","item_hash_version":2,"message":""}
